SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:27:21 and reappears at 18:34:47 IST\, se
 en from Kurnool.\nThe Moon is 37° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +12°.\n
 Times against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon
 's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Kurnool
